---
import { Container } from '@components/Container/Container';
import { AnimateInView } from '@components/Animate/AnimateInView';
---

<Container as="section" pt={8} pb={7}>
  <AnimateInView
    client:visible
    as="h1"
    className="font-serif rs-mb-3 font-normal fluid-type-4 leading-display"
  >
    Why Web Services
  </AnimateInView>
  <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row rs-gap-3">
    <AnimateInView
      client:visible
      as="p"
      delay={0.1}
      className="basis-2/5 fluid-type-2 leading-cozy text-primary mb-0"
    >
      Security, legal compliance, and malicious traffic are challenges we know well — so you don’t have to.
    </AnimateInView>
    <AnimateInView
      client:visible
      as="p"
      delay={0.2}
      animation="slideInFromRight"
      className="basis-3/5 big-paragraph text-secondary-muted leading-normal text-primary-muted mb-0"
    >
      Websites are simple to launch but difficult to maintain. Behind every university web property lies a network
      of security requirements, accessibility standards, brand compliance, and ongoing vulnerability management
      that most content owners never see coming, until something goes wrong. We’ve spent years building platforms
      and practices that handle all of it, so you can focus on your communication strategy.
    </AnimateInView>
  </div>
</Container>
